		{"id":"cc6044c8224ef5f5","type":"text","text":"#9 · Cut the third-party critical path (M)\nPlex CSS is render-blocking and cross-origin, then the woff2 — two RTTs before FCP, which delays the CSS intro start. Self-host Plex woff2 + `preload`, or `display=optional` for first landing.","x":550,"y":40,"width":420,"height":150,"color":"1"},
